  "notes": "Distinguished from the homophones {務|つと}める (to serve in a role/position) and {勤|つと}める (to work at a company). {努|つと}める specifically means making a conscious effort or striving toward something.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ～に{努|つと}める — to work toward ~\n- ～ように{努|つと}める — to make an effort to ~\n- {努|つと}めて (adverbial) — making an effort to; deliberately\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {改善|かいぜん}に{努|つと}める — to strive to improve\n- {理解|りかい}に{努|つと}める — to try to understand\n- {冷静|れいせい}でいるように{努|つと}める — to try to stay calm\n- {節約|せつやく}に{努|つと}める — to try to economize",
